        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Chipping Barnet, London\n- Organizations: House of Commons, UK Parliament, Conservative Party\n- People: Theresa Villiers\n- Topics: UK Parliament constituencies, British politics\n\nFacts:\n- Chipping Barnet is a UK Parliament constituency that was created in 1974.\n- Chipping Barnet has been represented in the House of Commons of the UK Parliament since 2005 by Theresa Villiers of the Conservative Party.\n- Theresa Anne Villiers was born on 5 March 1968 in London.\n- Theresa Anne Villiers is pronounced \"Villers\".\n- Theresa Anne Villiers is a British politician in the Conservative Party.",
